This is your 80s education, a brand new, better protocol

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:33.608
This is the sound of your salvation, a mixtape here to break your fall

00:01:33.668 --> 00:01:42.670
It's not the beat of her machine, it's the music in between

00:01:42.670 --> 00:01:56.902
[Bright 80s Synth-Pop Hook]

