00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:13.932
But this is like a different age, a flower in full bloom

00:02:14.933 --> 00:02:20.957
I've never heard this music, I've never felt this free

00:02:20.997 --> 00:02:27.910
Is this what I was missing? Is this all for me?

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:36.500
It's all for you, the high, the low, the sappy songs that make you cry

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:44.515
The harbor in the storm, you know, the soundtrack for your brand new sky

00:02:52.243 --> 00:03:00.000
This is your 80s education, a brand new, better protocol

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:07.926
This is the sound of your salvation, a mixtape here to break your fall

